# Addon rename → restart dev watch

Whenever an addon folder under `Addons/` is **renamed** (e.g. `LevelPace` → `WenDing`):

1. **Stop** any running `wowf-addons-dev.sh` process for the old addon name (and any watch still pointed at the old path).
2. **Start** a new watch for the new name via the `wowf-addons-dev` skill (`Scripts/wowf-addons-dev.sh <NewName>`).

Do this in the same turn as the rename when a watch was (or likely is) running — do not wait for the user to ask. Also uninstall/clean the old installed addon name if needed so the game does not keep a stale folder.
